{{!
    @template theme_epure/webapp_offline

    Page « You are offline » of the installable web app: self-contained, as nothing else is available offline.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * lang - Language of the page.
    * sitename - Name of the site.
    * brand - Brand colour.
    * onbrand - Colour of the text on the brand colour.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "lang": "en",
        "sitename": "Campus Horizon",
        "brand": "#1C6E73",
        "onbrand": "#FFFFFF"
    }
}}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="{{lang}}">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="{{brand}}">
    <title>{{#str}}webappoffline, theme_epure{{/str}} – {{sitename}}</title>
    <style>
        :root { color-scheme: light dark; }
        body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 1.5rem; box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; color: #1d2125; background: #f5f6f8; }
        main { max-width: 26rem; text-align: center; }
        .site { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.125rem; margin: 0 0 2rem; }
        h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0 0 .75rem; }
        p { line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 1.5rem; }
        button { font: inherit; font-weight: 600; padding: .75rem 1.5rem; border: 0; border-radius: .5rem; cursor: pointer;
            color: {{onbrand}}; background: {{brand}}; }
        button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid {{brand}}; outline-offset: 3px; }
        @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { body { color: #e6e8eb; background: #0f1217; } }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main>
        <p class="site">{{sitename}}</p>
        <h1>{{#str}}webappoffline, theme_epure{{/str}}</h1>
        <p>{{#str}}webappoffline_desc, theme_epure{{/str}}</p>
        <button type="button" onclick="location.reload()">{{#str}}webappretry, theme_epure{{/str}}</button>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
